<http://purl.org/spar/amo/leadsTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A warrant that points to a claim from the related evidence within an argument."@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/amo/leadsTo> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-warrant a amo:Warrant ;\n        amo:leadsTo :my-claim .\n\n    :my-claim a amo:Claim ." .
